+    // ---- pairing by QR (nothing to type) ---------------------------------------------------------
+
+    /**
+     * Pairing without a code: the Central shows a QR with a random service name and password
+     * (WIFI:T:ADB;S:name;P:password;;) and also hands both to this app. The user scans that QR in
+     * Settings ("Pair device with QR code"); Settings then advertises a pairing service called [name]
